## Smart Pointer Behavior

```xiom
pub interface Deref {
  type Target;
  fn deref(self: &Self) -> &Self::Target;
}
```

### Implementing Deref

```xiom
pub type MyBox[T] = { data: *T; }

impl Deref for MyBox[T] {
  type Target = T;

  fn deref(self: &MyBox[T]) -> &T {
    return self.data;  // Return reference to inner value
  }
}

fn main() {
  let b = MyBox{ data: &42 };
  let value: Int = *b;  // Deref: get the inner Int
  io.println(value.to_str());
}
```

### Method Forwarding

```xiom
pub type Password = Str;

impl Deref for Password {
  type Target = Str;

  fn deref(self: &Password) -> &Str {
    // Return reference to the underlying Str
    // allow access to Str methods directly
  }
}

let pwd: Password = "secret123".into();
let len = pwd.len();  // Calls Str::len() through Deref!
```

### Deref Coercion

```xiom
fn print_str(s: &Str) { io.println(s); }

let pwd: Password = "hello".into();
print_str(&pwd);  // &Password auto-coerces to &Str via Deref!
```

### Guarded Wrapper

```xiom
pub type Sensitive[T] = T;

impl Deref for Sensitive[T] {
  type Target = T;
  fn deref(self: &Sensitive[T]) -> &T { /* access logged */ }
}
```

